<p id="q9">9. For borrowers of an eligible size for the MSLP that made a C&amp;I loan inquiry and to which <em>your bank did not approve an MSLP loan, even though your bank was registered for the MSLP</em>, how important were the following reasons in preventing participation in the MSLP? (Please rate each possible reason using the following scale: 1=not important, 2=somewhat important, 3=very important.)</p>

